compiler, an independently audited kernel or a release authority.

Local integration preserves those two sources byte-for-byte inside deterministic
gzip archives and verifies their decompressed hashes before use. Local host
adapters, verification scripts and tests have been reformatted and updated for
the current VAT owner and portable temporary imports. Bend kernels are unchanged.

No production credentials, company financial records or third-party font files
are included. All fixtures are synthetic.
